| Item | Fact |
| --- | --- |
| Brahmo Sabha | Rammohan Roy, 1828 |
| Sati abolished | Regulation XVII, William Bentinck, 1829 |
| Widows' Remarriage Act | 1856, championed by Vidyasagar |
| Age of Consent Act | 1891 |
| Arya Samaj | Dayananda, 1875; "Back to the Vedas" |
